# ============================================================================
# UFFT public repo .gitignore
#
# Strategy: ALLOWLIST — the default state of any file or folder is NOT
# published. Only paths explicitly un-ignored below are pushed to GitHub.
# ============================================================================

# Ignore everything by default
*

# --- Root essentials ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

# --- Canonical math documents ---
!UFFT_Core_Framework_v9.md
!From_Foam_to_Fermions.md

# --- Published papers ---
!papers
!papers/**

# --- Education (explainers, worksheets, presentations) ---
!streams
!streams/education
!streams/education/**

# --- Reproducibility artefacts ---
!verification
!verification/**

# --- Defensive re-ignores (generic patterns only) ---
**/DRAFT_*
**/*.request.yaml
**/drafts/
**/CLAUDE.md
**/REGISTER.md
**/_INDEX.md
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/*.md.pdf
